  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Yemen Emergency and Multi-Sectoral Lifesaving Interventions II (YEMLI-II)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">YEMLI II &quot;The goal of the Yemen Emergency and Multi-Sectoral Lifesaving Interventions II (YEMLI-II) activity is to provide life-saving interventions to crisis-affected communities in Yemen to address dire health conditions and alleviate underlying food security issues. --- FOOD SECURITY --- USAID/BHA</narrative>
  </description>
